1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,667
Welcome to Class 1 Qatar History and Citizenship! Today we will learn all about our daily routine and how we organize our day.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:26,160
A daily routine is what we do every day in a clear order. Look at our three daily cards: in the morning, we wake up and clean ourselves; in the daytime, we learn at school; and in the evening, we sleep on time.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:51,072
Let us start with our morning habits! Step one: we wake up early in the morning feeling rested, energetic, and happy to begin a new day. Step two: we go to the bathroom sink, wash our hands and face with clean water, and brush our teeth carefully every morning so we stay clean, fresh, and healthy.

4
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:15,464
Next, we get ready for a wonderful day at school! Step three: we sit at the table and eat a healthy morning breakfast with nutritious food and milk to give our body energy to learn. Step four: we put on our neat, clean school uniform and pack our books inside our schoolbag before leaving home.

5
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:40,688
Now we arrive at school! In our Class 1 classroom, we greet our teacher and sit attentively with our friends. Look at the classroom board: first, we listen carefully to our teacher's instructions. Second, we learn new things together. Third, we follow our school rules kindly.

6
00:01:42,000 --> 00:02:04,280
At the end of the day, evening arrives and the bright crescent moon and stars shine outside our bedroom window. We tidy up our room, put away our school things for tomorrow, and get into our cozy bed. Going to bed on time every night is an important healthy habit so we wake up rested and happy.

7
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:37,264
Let us review all six steps of our daily routine in order, from first to last! First, step one: wake up early in the morning. Next, step two: wash and brush our teeth. Step three: eat a healthy morning breakfast. Step four: get dressed in our neat school uniform. Later, step five: go to school and learn. Finally, step six: sleep on time at night!

8
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:49,216
Wonderful listening! You have learned all about your daily routine in order. Now you are ready to try one practice question from your school study material with your tutor.
